    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "本文档用于指导外包制作 Live2D 数字人模型。本版为最小可用版本，仅满足基础对话场景。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-divider-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "一、技术规格",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-fallback-block fallback-async-sheet fallback-async-align-left"
    },
    {
      "id": "7",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-divider-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "8",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "二、必需参数（Parameters）",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "9",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "参数 ID 请严格使用 Cubism 默认命名。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-sheet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-divider-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "三、口型同步（LipSync）要求",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "程序会通过 ParamMouthOpenY 参数实时驱动嘴巴开合，模拟说话口型。该参数的值范围是 0（闭嘴）~ 1（张嘴最大）。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "对嘴部建模的要求",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\nParamMouthOpenY = 0 时：嘴巴完全闭合，自然状态",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\nParamMouthOpenY = 1 时：嘴巴张到最大",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\n中间值（0.2~0.8）应有平滑的过渡，不能出现跳变或形变异常",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\n嘴部形变需要在 0~1 全范围内看起来自然，因为程序会输出各种中间值",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "建模细节建议",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "程序内部会产生以下几种典型开合度，请确保这些值下嘴型看起来合理：",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-sheet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "重要约束",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\n动作（motion）和表情（expression）中都不要对 ParamMouthOpenY 设置关键帧，否则会与程序的实时口型驱动冲突",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\n如果嘴部有多个参数（如 ParamMouthForm 控制嘴型宽窄），可以保留，但 ParamMouthOpenY 必须留给程序独占",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-divider-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "四、动作（Motions）要求",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "不需要表情文件，不需要情绪系统。只需要以下动作：",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "动作组结构",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-sheet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "Idle 组（至少 1 个）",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "自然站立的待机循环动画，有轻微呼吸感。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "TapBody 组（共 5 个动作）",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "程序按 数组下标（从 0 开始） 调用，顺序必须严格按下表排列：",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-sheet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "动作制作要求",
      "type": "block docx-heading3-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\nFadeInTime 和 FadeOutTime 设为 0.5 秒",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\n动作时长 2~4 秒",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "38",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\n动作结束后能自然过渡回待机姿态",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "39",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\n动作中不要包含 ParamMouthOpenY 的关键帧，口型由程序实时驱动，写入会冲突",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "40",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-divider-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "41",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "五、model3.json 结构要求",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "42",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "以 MyModel 为例：",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "43",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n代码块\nJSON\n复制\n{\n  \"Version\": 3,\n  \"FileReferences\": {\n    \"Moc\": \"MyModel.moc3\",\n    \"Textures\": [\"MyModel.2048/texture_00.png\"],\n    \"Physics\": \"MyModel.physics3.json\",\n    \"Motions\": {\n      \"Idle\": [\n        { \"File\": \"motions/idle.motion3.json\", \"FadeInTime\": 0.5, \"FadeOutTime\": 0.5 }\n      ],\n      \"TapBody\": [\n        { \"File\": \"motions/listen.motion3.json\", \"FadeInTime\": 0.5, \"FadeOutTime\": 0.5 },\n        { \"File\": \"motions/speak.motion3.json\", \"FadeInTime\": 0.5, \"FadeOutTime\": 0.5 },\n        { \"File\": \"motions/think.motion3.json\", \"FadeInTime\": 0.5, \"FadeOutTime\": 0.5 },\n        { \"File\": \"motions/wait.motion3.json\", \"FadeInTime\": 0.5, \"FadeOutTime\": 0.5 },\n        { \"File\": \"motions/greet.motion3.json\", \"FadeInTime\": 0.5, \"FadeOutTime\": 0.5 }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"Groups\": [\n    {\n      \"Target\": \"Parameter\",\n      \"Name\": \"EyeBlink\",\n      \"Ids\": [\"ParamEyeLOpen\", \"ParamEyeROpen\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"Target\": \"Parameter\",\n      \"Name\": \"LipSync\",\n      \"Ids\": [\"ParamMouthOpenY\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"HitAreas\": [\n    { \"Id\": \"HitArea\", \"Name\": \"Body\" }\n  ]\n}\n",
      "type": "block docx-code-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "44",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "关键点：",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "45",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\nGroups 中 EyeBlink 和 LipSync 必须声明，程序依赖这两个组实现自动眨眼和口型同步",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "46",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "•\nTapBody 数组中的顺序必须是：聆听、说话、思考、等待、打招呼",
      "type": "block docx-bullet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "47",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-divider-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "48",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "六、目录结构",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "49",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\nMyModel/\n├── MyModel.model3.json\n├── MyModel.moc3\n├── MyModel.physics3.json\n├── MyModel.2048/\n│   └── texture_00.png\n└── motions/\n    ├── idle.motion3.json\n    ├── listen.motion3.json      # 下标 0 - 聆听\n    ├── speak.motion3.json       # 下标 1 - 说话\n    ├── think.motion3.json       # 下标 2 - 思考\n    ├── wait.motion3.json        # 下标 3 - 等待\n    └── greet.motion3.json       # 下标 4 - 打招呼\n",
      "type": "block docx-code-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "50",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-divider-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "51",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "七、交付清单",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "52",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-sheet-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "53",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-divider-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "54",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "八、注意事项",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "55",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "1.\nParamMouthOpenY 不要动：动作中不要对嘴巴参数设关键帧，程序实时驱动口型",
      "type": "block docx-ordered-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "56",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "2.\n动作组必须叫 Idle 和 TapBody：程序按这两个名字查找",
      "type": "block docx-ordered-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "57",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "3.\nTapBody 顺序不能变：程序按下标 0~4 调用，顺序错了动作就对不上",
      "type": "block docx-ordered-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "58",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "4.\nEyeBlink 和 LipSync Groups 不能漏：没有这两个声明，自动眨眼和口型同步不会生效",
      "type": "block docx-ordered-block"
    }
  ],
  "chars": 2547,
  "captured_at": "2026-11-03T10:42:35.822Z"
}